                        <item xml:id="a7">
                           <locus target="#30v-31r">-30v-31r</locus>
                           <desc>Fā'ida</desc>
                           <q>Duʻā' to be recited the 1st day of Muḥarram to be preserved from the Devil the whole year.</q>
                           <note/>
                        </item>
                        <item xml:id="a8">
                           <locus target="#31r-32r">-31r-32r</locus>
                           <desc>Duʻā'</desc>
                           <q>Aḏkār and duʻā' to be recited on the day of ʻAšūrā'. The are quoted from al-Aǧhūrī, who quotes from the Kitāb al-Ǧāwāhir al-Ḫams of Muḥammad b. Ḫaṭīr al-Dīn al-ʻAṭṭār.</q>
                           <note/>
                        </item>
